<title>USA: BASEBALL-YANKEES WIN WORLD SERIES.</title>
<headline>BASEBALL-YANKEES WIN WORLD SERIES.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Yankees beat the Atlanta Braves 3-2 on Saturday to win the 1996 World Series four games to two.</p>
</text>
